---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Samband
description: Fá samband við GameJam Føroya — teldupostur, telefon og adressa.
---

<section class="section page-head">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="page-head__title">Fá samband</h1>
    <p class="section__lead">
      Hevur tú spurningar, vilt tú vera við, ella hugsar tú um at stuðla?
      Vit vilja fegin hoyra frá tær.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="reach-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2 class="section__title" id="reach-title">Skriva ella ring</h2>
      {#- The whole tile is the link, so it stays an easy tap on a phone.
          The postal address lives in the "Felagsskapurin" panel below. -#}
      <ul class="contact__methods" role="list">
        <li>
          <a class="contact__method" href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">
            <span class="contact__label">Teldupostur</span>
            <span class="contact__value">{{ site.email }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a class="contact__method" href="tel:{{ site.phone | replace(' ', '') }}">
            <span class="contact__label">Telefon</span>
            <span class="contact__value">{{ site.phone }}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="sponsor-title">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section__title" id="sponsor-title">Kundi tú hugsað tær at stuðla?</h2>
    <p class="section__lead">
      Okkara tiltøk eru 100% ókeypis fyri luttakararnar. Stuðulin verður
      nýttur til mat, drekka, vinningar og undirvísingartilfar.
      Skriva til okkum á <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>,
      so senda vit tær eina lýsing av møguleikum.
    </p>
    <p class="section__lead">
      <a href="/#sponsors">Sí, hvørji stuðla okkum í dag.</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="org-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="panel">
      <h2 class="section__title" id="org-title">Felagsskapurin</h2>
      <p class="section__lead">
        {{ site.legalName }} · {{ site.orgType }}<br>
        V-tal {{ site.vtal }}<br>
        {{ site.address }}
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
